    "notes": [
      "One real 16KiB128bit1RW,8signed8x8,1signed32x32 with two64bit response slots,1SFU and1bridge. No copies hidden in M/A/R controllers.",
      "All three controllers, all lineholders, wide comparison/shift/RNE, metadata/registry, lease mux/control, result export and abort-drain counters are mapped. Arithmetic sharing does not remove inactive controller area.",
      "SRAM is a behavioral wrapper omitted from logic area, no SRAM/ROM macro/CTS/RC/PVT/physical qualification.",
      "External readonly C0 LUT128KiB, mutable Falcon1MiB and M/A backing payloads remain finite explicitly allocated inventories; all reads/writes pay the same five128bit beats.",
      "External two response slots at least320bit+control,32bit request/response epoch sideband serialization not included in five128bit packet payload beats.",
      "Granite dedicated V/M, materialized GQA A, singlehead Falcon R have actual unique service bank; GDN104 is not connected.",
      "Area sum of old independent cores has different resource inventory and is only a descriptive reference, not a same-resource PPA improvement."
    ]
